[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（投稿したコラボ動画は大好評。互いの視聴者層を\n\u3000取り込んで、再生数も大きく伸びた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The collab video was a massive hit. They pulled in viewers from both audiences, and the view count skyrocketed.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（その後に投稿した動画も、\n\u3000どんどん勢いを増していき……そして）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Every video they uploaded after that kept building momentum... until finally—)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（審査の日が、やって来た）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Judging day arrived.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うう……社長、まだ来ないの？\nそろそろ結果が出ててもおかしくないよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... where is she? The results should be in by now, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やっぱり不合格だったのかな！？\nああ、もう！\u3000待つことしかできないなんて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What if we didn't make it?! Ugh, I can't stand just sitting here waiting!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "落ち着きなさいよ、かっこ悪い。\nドーンと構えてなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Would you calm down? You look ridiculous. Show some composure."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういうヨハナだって、先ほどから時計ばかり\n見ているでござるよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And yet you have been glancing at the clock every few minutes yourself, Johanna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うるさいわね……その口、\nテープで塞いでやろうかしら……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shut it... or I'll tape your mouth shut myself...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "や、やめてくだされヨハナー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "P-please don't, Johanna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、元気ですわね。\nもっと緊張しているかと思いましたが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, you all seem quite lively. I expected you'd be more nervous."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この二人が緊張でおかしくなっていまする！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "These two are losing it from nerves!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あらあら。では、早く結果を知らせませんと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my. Then I had best put you out of your misery."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お願い！\u3000早く教えて！\n……ううん、やっぱやめて！\u3000まだ覚悟が！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please! Tell us already! ...Actually, wait! I don't think I'm ready!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……先に言っておきますわね。\n皆さんは、よく頑張りました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Let me say this first. You all worked incredibly hard."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この短期間で、ここまでたくさんのファンを獲得し、\n人気を得たのは素晴らしい功績ですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To have gained this many fans in such a short time—that is a remarkable achievement."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たとえ結果がどうであったとしても、\n自分に誇りを持つように",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whatever the outcome, hold your heads high and be proud of what you accomplished."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……合格ですわ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You passed!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ほ、本当でござるか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...R-really?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここで嘘をつく必要はないでしょう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Would I lie to you about something like this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、怖がらせるんじゃないわよ！\n何が「先に言っておきますわね」よ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then don't scare us like that! What was all that 'let me say this first' buildup about?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とにかく、選ばれたんだよね……アタシたち！\nやったー！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We did it... we actually made it! Yesss!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っと……キューン殿から？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh...? A message from Quinn?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……おお！？\u3000『ＱＥジーンズ』も合格との連絡が！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Wait! QE Jeans passed too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まさか、どっちも受かるなんて……奇跡ね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Both of us made it... I can hardly believe it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よかったね！\u3000それじゃあ、\nフェスでもキューンたちに会えるんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's amazing! So we'll get to see Quinn and the others at the festival!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さて、改めて……おめでとうございます、三人とも。\n今回の結果に関しては、先ほどの言葉の通りですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then—congratulations, all three of you. Everything I said before still stands."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しかし、気を抜いてはなりませんわ！\n次に待ち構えているのは、あのカウントダウンフェス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But do not let your guard down. The Countdown Festival is waiting, and it will not be easy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこで成功を収め、多くの観客の心を掴んでこそ、\n『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』の未来があるのです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Winning over the crowd there is what will truly secure Cutie☆AnimaL's future."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "明日からは厳しい練習の時間が続くでしょう。\n今夜は早めに寝て、ゆっくり休みなさいな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hard practice begins tomorrow. Tonight, get to bed early and rest well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか……冷静に考えたらそうだよね。\nここが終わりじゃないんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're right... when I think about it clearly, this isn't the finish line at all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "むしろここがスタートライン！\nさあ、明日からも頑張るわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's just the starting line! Come on, we've got work to do starting tomorrow!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ/鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana/Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "不要",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……鬼門。あなたはこの後少し、お時間よろしくて？\nあなた宛てに手紙が来ているのです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Kimon. Could I have a moment of your time afterward? There is a letter here addressed to you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたの、ご家族から",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "From your family."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "............!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]